@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_ColinIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_ColinIntro::
	.string "Do you have any moves that can strike\n"
	.string "a flying POKéMON?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_ColinDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_ColinDefeat::
	.string "You soared above me!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_ColinPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_ColinPostBattle::
	.string "The move FLY is convenient,\n"
	.string "don't you think?\p"
	.string "While the POKéMON is flying,\n"
	.string "almost no moves can strike it.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_RobertIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_RobertIntro::
	.string "My POKéMON is strong!\n"
	.string "How about yours?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_RobertDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_RobertDefeat::
	.string "Your POKéMON were stronger…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_RobertPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_RobertPostBattle::
	.string "A POKéMON that grows steadily is one\n"
	.string "you can count on.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_LorenzoIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_LorenzoIntro::
	.string "I'll check your POKéMON and see if\n"
	.string "they're fit for the outdoors.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_LorenzoDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_LorenzoDefeat::
	.string "With POKéMON that strong, you're in\n"
	.string "no danger of needing rescue!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_LorenzoPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_LorenzoPostBattle::
	.string "To travel wherever your heart desires\n"
	.string "with POKéMON…\l"
	.string "That's the joy of being a TRAINER.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_JennaIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_JennaIntro::
	.string "How's your physical fitness?\n"
	.string "If you're not fit, you could have a\l"
	.string "rough time in critical situations.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_JennaDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_JennaDefeat::
	.string "I'm totally fit, but…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_JennaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_JennaPostBattle::
	.string "Fitness training is in my routine.\n"
	.string "I always run with my POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_JeffreyIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_JeffreyIntro::
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\l"
	.string "Want to battle?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_JeffreyDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_JeffreyDefeat::
	.string "Lost it…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_JeffreyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_JeffreyPostBattle::
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\l"
	.string "I'll try harder…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_JenniferIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_JenniferIntro::
	.string "POKéMON have many special abilities.\n"
	.string "If you want to become a first-class\l"
	.string "TRAINER, learn about them.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_JenniferDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_JenniferDefeat::
	.string "You're obviously thinking.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_JenniferPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_JenniferPostBattle::
	.string "The special abilities of POKéMON\n"
	.string "will make battle styles change.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_ChipIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_ChipIntro::
	.string "Who might you be?\p"
	.string "Are you perhaps searching for ancient\n"
	.string "ruins that are rumored to possibly\l"
	.string "exist according to legend?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_ChipDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_ChipDefeat::
	.string "What a disgraceful setback…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_ChipPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_ChipPostBattle::
	.string "That giant rock… I would like to\n"
	.string "believe it may indeed contain ancient\l"
	.string "ruins. But I see no entrance.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_ClarissaIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_ClarissaIntro::
	.string "Why am I carrying this parasol?\p"
	.string "I'll tell you if you can win against me.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_ClarissaDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_ClarissaDefeat::
	.string "A parasol can't ward off POKéMON\n"
	.string "attacks…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_ClarissaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_ClarissaPostBattle::
	.string "I don't think strong sunlight is good\n"
	.string "for my POKéMON.\l"
	.string "So I shield them with my parasol.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_AngelicaIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_AngelicaIntro::
	.string "Me, POKéMON, and my parasol…\p"
	.string "If any one of them is missing,\n"
	.string "the picture of beauty will be ruined.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_AngelicaDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_AngelicaDefeat::
	.string "You've completely ruined my beauty…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_AngelicaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_AngelicaPostBattle::
	.string "A parasol wouldn't suit you at all.\p"
	.string "Why, something like this would only\n"
	.string "get in your way.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_KeigoIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_KeigoIntro::
	.string "I will adopt the movements of POKéMON\n"
	.string "and create new ninja techniques.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_KeigoDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_KeigoDefeat::
	.string "The creation of new ninja techniques\n"
	.string "is but a distant dream…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_KeigoPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_KeigoPostBattle::
	.string "Perhaps I ought to apprentice under\n"
	.string "a ninja sensei.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_RileyIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_RileyIntro::
	.string "We ninja conceal ourselves under our\n"
	.string "camouflage cloaks.\l"
	.string "I bet you didn't know where I was!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_RileyDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_RileyDefeat::
	.string "I lost!\n"
	.string "I should camouflage my shame!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_RileyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_RileyPostBattle::
	.string "Our camouflage cloaks are all\n"
	.string "handmade.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_CallieIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_CallieIntro::
	.string "If you don't pay attention,\n"
	.string "you could get hurt!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_CallieDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_CallieDefeat::
	.string "Ouch!\n"
	.string "I was the one to get hurt.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_CalliePostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_CalliePostBattle::
	.string "I wonder… Should I evolve my POKéMON?\n"
	.string "They're cute the way they are, though.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_LeonelIntro
Hoenn_Route120_Text_LeonelIntro::
	.string "Your party POKéMON…\n"
	.string "Do you have different types?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_LeonelDefeat
Hoenn_Route120_Text_LeonelDefeat::
	.string "I've seen your policy in action!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route120_Text_LeonelPostBattle
Hoenn_Route120_Text_LeonelPostBattle::
	.string "I think it's awesome you're so strong\n"
	.string "battling with your favorite POKéMON.$"

